msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"I don't get all of this talk of building a resort. What's so great about "
"Okinawa?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"A friend of mine once went over to the mainland, and he says that the ocean "
"there is really dirty. Nothing like the sparkling blue of our beaches."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Really? But don't people go swimming during the summer?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"That's because they don't know any better. Nobody who's ever been to Okinawa"
" could stand to swim in that sludge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Hmm. I guess that's why everyone comes to vacation here..."
msgstr ""

